Subject: expose final native execution facts for lowering
Upstream-Status: Local embedding (observer-only; not submitted)

Record the terminal handler's exact direct or labelled-supplement presentation
and the ordered label, target, and supplement phases.  Consumers can compact
semantic links without inferring formatter behavior from macro names or words.

Snapshot the active inline-equation delimiters on each tbl data cell as well.
The parser deliberately does not interpret equations while tbl is active; the
snapshot only authorizes a bounded, cell-local semantic enhancement after the
native table result has been accepted as authoritative.

